              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "mmett"
            },
            "reviewBody": "My family and I really enjoyed this soup. A few changes I made was instead of 6 cups of stock I used 3 cups of stock and 3 cups of milk. I also added 3 cups of shredded cheese instead of 2 1/2 and used red wine instead of white wine.",
