            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Christie Biggers"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was a really fragrant and delightful soup... very rich and tasty. Melting the cheese correctly is tricky, even for a fairly seasoned cheese soup maker. The temperature is a bit difficult to control. All in all, a lovely thing for a cold, rainy day!",
            "datePublished": "2009-09-18T14:16:07.443Z"
          },
