              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Kristen O'Brien"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This was too salty. I didn't even add any salt. It was just too potent. I just didn't like it.",
            "datePublished": "2007-03-21T18:11:46.263Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
